{"t":"say","text":"I'll add disaster recovery with cross-zone RDS standby, Cloud Backup for the database, and a GTM failover setup."}
{"t":"req","text":"Disaster recovery: system stays up if something fails"}
{"t":"plan","products":["gtm","cloud-backup"]}
