{"t":"edge","id":"e-db-backup","from":"db","to":"backup","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added GTM for DNS-level failover and Cloud Backup for automated RDS disaster recovery, all within Seoul region."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add a dedicated OSS bucket in Seoul for medical scans, keeping all health data inside South Korea."}
{"t":"node","id":"scans","product":"oss","label":"MRI/CT scans","group":"kr","why":"Stores uploaded MRI and CT scan files within Seoul region."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-scans","from":"app","to":"scans","label":"upload"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added a dedicated OSS node in Seoul for MRI/CT scan uploads from the booking servers."}

{"t":"say","text":"상품 검색을 OpenSearch에서 Elasticsearch로 교체하겠습니다."}
{"t":"node","id":"search","product":"elasticsearch","label":"Product search","group":"vpc","why":"Elasticsearch로 상품 전문 검색과 벡터 검색을 처리합니다."}
