{"t":"done","summary":"Token Plan provides team seats and per-member API keys so all 12 developers can use Qwen models in Cline at a predictable monthly cost."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a minimal, cost-efficient blog architecture using SAE and RDS to stay within your $150 monthly budget."}
{"t":"req","text":"Monthly cloud budget is $150 max"}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","cdn","alb","sae","rds","oss"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Readers","group":"internet","why":"People reading the newspaper blog."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the blog domain name cheaply."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"cdn","product":"cdn","label":"CDN","group":"edge","why":"Caches articles and images to save origin bandwidth costs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-cdn","from":"users","to":"cdn","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Blog VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes traffic to the app; pay-per-use fits low budgets."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-cdn-alb","from":"cdn","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"sae","label":"Blog App","group":"vpc","why":"Serverless containers scale to zero, saving compute costs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Blog DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Small managed MySQL for posts, comments and users."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Media Storage","group":"sg","why":"Stores article images cheaply, served directly via CDN."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-cdn-media","from":"cdn","to":"media","label":"images"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Budget-friendly blog using CDN, ALB, SAE (scales to zero), basic RDS and OSS for media storage."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add a comment service on SAE with its own RDS instance. This adds modest cost but stays under $150."}
{"t":"req","text":"Monthly cloud budget is $150 max"}
{"t":"node","id":"comments","product":"sae","label":"Comment Service","group":"vpc","why":"Handles reader comments separately from the blog app."}
{"t":"node","id":"comment-db","product":"rds","label":"Comments DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores reader comments with zone standby for reliability."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-comments","from":"alb","to":"comments","label":"comments"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-comments-commentdb","from":"comments","to":"comment-db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added a dedicated SAE comment service and RDS database, keeping total spend within the $150 budget."}

{"t":"req","text":"Monthly cloud budget is $150 max"}
{"t":"say","text":"I'll merge comments into the blog app to save one RDS instance, and add WAF on ALB for protection. Net cost stays under $150."}
{"t":"remove","id":"comments"}
{"t":"remove","id":"comment-db"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"sae","label":"Blog App","group":"vpc","why":"Runs blog and comments together, saving a second RDS cost."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-comments","from":"alb","to":"app","label":"comments"}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks attacks that caused the outage, no extra infra cost."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Merged comment service into main SAE app, removed extra RDS, added WAF badge on ALB; resilient and under $150 budget."}

{"t":"say","text":"Mumbai (ap-south-1) is closed, so I'll place the game in Singapore and use ESA to keep latency low for Indian players."}
